      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/jameelizae/status/2033230279318683967",
      "text": "week recap (one of the craziest weeks I’ve had) 🤣\n\n> went to Dubai to prepare for the @ShardDubai annual event.\n> then got stranded because of the Iran-Israel-US tension.\nUAE was technically safe, but flights started getting messy.\n> needed to go home for health reasons → panic buying tickets while prices were insane.\n> UAE → Oman (9 hour trip).\n> from Oman my route was supposed to be:\nIndia → Thailand → Philippines.\n> plot twist: Philippines passport needs a visa for India.\nfound out at the airport. 🥲\n> had a small breakdown, called family, booked a new route:\nOman → Thailand.\n> landed in Thailand… but my baggage stayed in Oman. fml. 🙃\n> meanwhile the market was nuking and I’m questioning my career.\n> finally landed in the Philippines.\ngot held at customs.\n> went for a check-up and almost got admitted.\n\nweek full of uncertainties but somehow dodged everything. 😎\n\nmarket was down that week…\nbut so was I lol. 🤣",
